sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant View as Django view
  participant Helper as send_email_sync
  participant Template as Email template
  participant SG as SendGrid API
  participant Brevo as Brevo SMTP
  participant Console as Django console backend
  participant Logs as Application logs

  User->>View: Register / verify / reset / delete
  View->>Template: Build recipient and message/link
  Template-->>Helper: Rendered subject/body
  Helper->>SG: Construct SendGrid client with timeout=10
  Note over Helper,SG: Installed SDK constructor rejects this timeout keyword; TypeError is caught.
  alt BREVO_SMTP_KEY configured
    Helper->>Brevo: SMTP send; EMAIL_TIMEOUT=10s
    Brevo-->>Helper: SMTP result
  else BREVO_SMTP_KEY absent
    Helper->>Console: Write email to console backend
    Console-->>Helper: Local console output, not recipient delivery
  end
  Helper->>Logs: Log recipient/provider result or exception text
  Helper-->>View: Return helper result
  View-->>User: HTTP response

  Note over View,Brevo: Synchronous request-path send; no durable outbox, worker, bounce webhook or delivery ledger found.
